  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://nyako.gay/assets/vanityslots.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>VanitySlots</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>VanitySlots</strong>&nbsp;是一個使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/emilyalexandra/trinkets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets API</a>&nbsp;為你的物品欄新增&nbsp;<strong>四個額外護甲槽位</strong>&nbsp;的模組。放入這四個額外槽位的護甲將取代你實際穿戴的護甲進行渲染，這意味著你可以隨意穿戴任何護甲，同時保持外觀時尚。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>VanitySlots</strong>&nbsp;還新增了&nbsp;<strong>四件額外的護甲</strong>&nbsp;，用於隱藏你當前穿戴的護甲。這些護甲可以在工作台上透過用八顆螢石粉包圍皮革護甲來製作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://nyako.gay/assets/vanityslots_crafting.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"140\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>透過設定選項（預設關閉），<strong>怪物將根據它們所能看到的內容做出反應，而非你實際穿戴的護甲。</strong> 如果你在虛飾槽位中放置了黃金護甲，豬布林就不會攻擊你。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"https://github.com/NyakoFox/VanitySlots/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"於 GitHub 取得\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanityslots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"於 CurseForge 取得\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvanity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"於 Modrinth 取得\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnyakofox\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 支持我們\"></a><a href=\"https://patreon.com/nyakofox\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Patreon 支持我們\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a></p>",
